match-borrow-error-variant

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Recognize the error that the &str visitor returns for an owned string by its variant and expected text instead of its Display text. Display runs the snippet renderer, so the text test linked annotate-snippets into every binary that derives a struct with string keys.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream serde-saphyr deserialize_str stops calling Display on a visitor error.
